:: Fishing Forest Lake Magnet Scrap Catch
<<effects>>
<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
You pry it off the magnet and stow it away. You might be able to sell it for scrap.
<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap)>>
<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingForestLake")>>
<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Forest Lake Magnet Pull Dagger
<<effects>>
The magnet drags up something long and solid. You pry a rusted dagger off it, the blade eaten through with rust, the hilt barely recognisable. A collector might pay for something this old.
<<museumAntiqueStatus "antiqueforestdagger" "found">>
<<set $antiquemoney += 150>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Forest Lake Wait]]>><</link>>
